  "options.overgrown_vegetation.show_all_ferns.tooltip": "Draws fern fronds folded along their midrib (two planes per frond). When off, each frond is a single flat plane, roughly halving the face count (all 6 fronds are drawn either way). Overgrown terrain is packed with undergrowth, so this is the biggest single FPS factor.",
